#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_context_menus.html.heex:50
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Right-click a channel in the conversations sidebar to see: Mark as Read, Mute/Unmute Channel, Copy Name, Leave Channel, Channel Settings. This mute controls notifications for the conversation; it is different from the channel-level user mute in nickname menus."
msgstr ""
"Klicken Sie mit der rechten Maustaste auf einen Kanal in der "
"Gesprächsseitenleiste, um zu sehen: Mark as Read, Mute/Unmute Channel, Copy "
"Name, Leave Channel, Channel Settings. Diese Mute steuert Benachrichtigungen"
" für das Gespräch; es unterscheidet sich von der Channel-Level-Benutzer mute"
" in Spitznamen-Menüs."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_context_menus.html.heex:11
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Right-click a nickname in a chat message to see: Private Message, Whois, Last Seen (Whowas), Copy Nick, Ignore/Unignore, Add to Address Book, Set Nick Color. Registered users also see P2P actions: P2P Session, Audio Call, Video Call, Send File (disabled if target is not registered or is yourself). Channel operators also see: Invite to Channel..., Kick, Ban, status-aware Give/Remove Voice, status-aware Give/Remove Op, and Mute/Unmute (channel)."
msgstr ""
"Klicken Sie mit der rechten Maustaste auf einen Spitznamen in einer Chat-"
"Nachricht zu sehen: Private Nachricht, Whois, Last Seen (Whowas), Copy Nick,"
" Ignore/Unignore, Add to Address Book, Set Nick Color. Registrierte Benutzer"
" sehen auch P2P-Aktionen: P2P-Session, Audio-Call, Video-Call, Send File "
"(ausgewählt, wenn Ziel nicht registriert ist oder selbst). Kanalbetreiber "
"sehen auch: Invite to Channel..., Kick, Ban, status-aware Give/Remove Voice,"
" status-aware Give/Remove Op und Mute/Unmute (Kanal)."

